#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of nlohmann-json"
msgstr "Instalação do nlohmann-json"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "Install nlohmann-json by running the following commands:"
msgstr "Instale nlohmann-json executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:81
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D JSON_BuildTests=OFF       \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \\\n"
"      -D JSON_BuildTests=OFF       \\\n"
"      -G Ninja ..</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you removed the <parameter>-D JSON_BuildTests=OFF</parameter> parameter, "
"run the test suite by issuing <command>ninja &amp;&amp; ninja "
"test</command>. 4 tests are known to fail which fetch contents, but they "
"require that a Git repository for the project is set up."
msgstr ""
"Se você removeu o parâmetro <parameter>-D JSON_BuildTests=OFF</parameter>, "
"execute a suíte de teste emitindo <command>ninja &amp;&amp; ninja "
"test</command>. 4 testes são conhecidos por falharem, os quais buscam "
"conteúdo, porém eles exigem que um repositório Git para o projeto esteja "
"configurado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:101
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/genlib/nlohmann-json.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D JSON_BuildTests=OFF</parameter>: This parameter disables "
"building tests, as they can take a while to build. Remove this option if you"
" want to run the test suite."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D JSON_BuildTests=OFF</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita "
"construir testes, pois eles pode levar algum tempo para construir. Remova "
"essa opção se você quiser executar a suíte de teste."

